# CR 608.2b: human casts Rabid Bite (Grizzly Bears bites Hill Giant); ai
# responds by bolting the Bears. When Rabid Bite resolves its first target is
# illegal and removed (MagicStack.hasFizzled), but the Hill Giant target is
# still legal, so the spell resolves -- and DamageSource$ ParentTarget names
# no card (getParentTargetingCard finds no ancestor still targeting one), so
# no damage is dealt (DamageDealEffect.java:135-138). Not an error.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 7 G
tapformana ai 6 R
queue paygeneric G
queue targets 3
queue targets 4
queue targets 3
queue action human cast 1
queue action ai cast 5
passpriority
